<title>USA: T-NETIX settles BellSouth patent suit.</title>
<headline>T-NETIX settles BellSouth patent suit.</headline>
<dateline>ENGLEWOOD, Colo. 1997-02-27</dateline>
<text>
<p>T-NETIX Inc said on Thursday it settled its patent-infringement lawsuit against BellSouth Corp.</p>
<p>Under the agreement, T-NETIX said it licensed BellSouth to provide three-way call detection services to correctional institutions in exchange for certain royalties.</p>
<p>BellSouth also dropped its counter-suit against T-NETIX, according to T-NETIX.</p>
<p>T-NETIX provides telecommunications companies with fraud-prevention and other services for handling inmate calls.</p>
<p>	  ((-- New York Newsdesk 212 859-1610))</p>
</text>
